                  "status": "Open",
                  "severity": "High",
                  "type": "Spoofing",
                  "description": "An attacker uses stolen or guessed credentials to impersonate a legitimate user and gain unauthorized access. Without MFA, there is no second factor to block the attacker.",
                  "mitigation": "Implement Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA), enforce account lockout after failed attempts, and use CAPTCHA to prevent automated login attacks.",
